{
  "version": "v1",
  "frozen": "2026-10-27",
  "note": "Fixed prompt set for planner evaluation (C4). 'expect' is the correct planner behaviour: ok = a valid plan, clarify = must ask, unsupported = must refuse to guess, invalid = must be rejected by the validator.",
